@startuml kairos-pledge-tracker-and-export-financial-report-sequence
title View Pledge Tracker and Export Financial Report

actor Admin
participant "Web Admin" as WebAdmin
participant "Kairos API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

Admin -> WebAdmin: Open Pledge Tracker
WebAdmin -> API: GET /finance/pledges?branchId=...
API -> DB: SELECT pledges + fulfilled amounts
DB --> API: data
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK {pledges}
WebAdmin --> Admin: Render pledge progress

Admin -> WebAdmin: Click "Export Report"
WebAdmin -> API: GET /finance/reports/export?format=CSV
API -> DB: Aggregate financial data
DB --> API: rows
API --> WebAdmin: 200 OK (file stream)

WebAdmin --> Admin: Trigger file download

@enduml
